    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114668" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρησμόλογ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uttering oracles,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἀνήρ</span>”
				<i>soothsayer, diviner,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.62
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.96
			</span></i>; of Musaeus, <i><span class="en">
